{"3916020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Sacrilege", "steam_appid": 3916020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4037250], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >         <strong>                               </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/649d05a6e82646fa61fdec02f8e6d515.avif?t=1777653793\" width=800 height=499 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                  <strong>Created by Marco Di Girolamo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>                                     &quot;An interactive cinematic experience like you've never had before&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience <i><strong>The Sacrilege,</strong></i> a visual and narrative adventure that combines the language of <i><strong>cinema</strong></i> with the interactivity of <i><strong>video games</strong></i>. Every <strong>scene</strong>, every <strong>shot</strong>, every <i><strong>piece of dialogue</strong></i> has been meticulously crafted to draw you into an <strong>intense</strong>, <strong>dark</strong>, and deeply immersive <strong>dramatic</strong> <i><strong>story</strong></i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A True Vision of Cinematic Direction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in an <i><strong>art-house film</strong></i>, you will be the one to make the <i>film flow</i>: interact with the <strong>environment</strong>, experience the <strong>crucial moments</strong> thanks to the <strong>direction developed in the film.</strong> But to move forward, you'll have to <i>interact with the minigames</i>. Only then can the story continue, <i>blending</i> <i><strong>art and interaction.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/d391d0f3517fd30296535c2aff284adc.webp?t=1777653793\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Unforgettable Music Score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>powerful combination</strong> of original cinematic orchestrations, electronics and rock accompanies every moment of the game, <strong>underscoring emotions</strong> and <strong>plot twists</strong> with a <i>unique and evocative style.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/9d4b7e3f58750b010352a959478e0ff8.webp?t=1777653793\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dramatic Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>plot</strong> unfolds on a <strong>psychological and dramatic horror plane.</strong> It is a story of <strong>death</strong>, <strong>revenge</strong> and <strong>mystery</strong> - <i>a dark enigma just waiting to be solved.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/6090cb8c154273496ed47af053033371.webp?t=1777653793\" width=700 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Development Of The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The film for the <strong>player</strong> is divided into <u><strong>CHAPTERS</strong></u>:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                                                    <i><strong>-CHAPTER 1</strong></i><strong>-</strong>      </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>                                                      </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916020/extras/81991f